    "stem": "公司为客户提供应用程序。该应用程序具有一个 Amazon API Gateway REST API，该 API 调用一个 AWS Lambda 函数。在初始化时，Lambda 函数从一个 Amazon DynamoDB 表中加载大量数据。数据加载过程导致冷启动时间长达 8-10 秒。DynamoDB 表已配置了 DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX)。客户报告应用程序偶尔会在响应请求时花费很长时间。应用程序在一天中收到数千个请求。在中午时分，应用程序比一天中的任何其他时间都要多收到 10 倍的请求。近日终，应用程序的请求量降至正常总量的 10%。一名 DevOps 工程师需要在一天中的所有时间内减少 Lambda 函数的延迟。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company provides an application to customers. The application has an Amazon API Gateway REST API that invokes an AWS Lambda function. On initialization, the Lambda function loads a large amount of data from an Amazon DynamoDB table. The data load process results in long cold- start times of 8-10 seconds. The DynamoDB table has DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX) configured. Customers report that the application intermittently takes a long time to respond to requests. The application receives thousands of requests throughout the day. In the middle of the day, the application experiences 10 times more requests than at any other time of the day. Near the end of the day, the application's request volume decreases to 10% of its normal total. A DevOps engineer needs to reduce the latency of the Lambda function at all times of the day. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "公司为客户提供应用程序。该应用程序具有一个 Amazon API Gateway REST API，该 API 调用一个 AWS Lambda 函数。在初始化时，Lambda 函数从一个 Amazon DynamoDB 表中加载大量数据。数据加载过程导致冷启动时间长达 8-10 秒。DynamoDB 表已配置了 DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX)。客户报告应用程序偶尔会在响应请求时花费很长时间。应用程序在一天中收到数千个请求。在中午时分，应用程序比一天中的任何其他时间都要多收到 10 倍的请求。近日终，应用程序的请求量降至正常总量的 10%。一名 DevOps 工程师需要在一天中的所有时间内减少 Lambda 函数的延迟。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
