    "topic": 1,
    "domain": "topic-1",
    "domainLabel": "Topic 1",
    "type": "choice",
    "stem": "公司有一个单独的 AWS 账户，运行在一个 AWS 区域内的 Amazon EC2 实例数量多达数百个。每小时新建和终止 EC2 实例。账户中也包括已经运行超过一周的 EC2 实例。公司的安全政策要求所有正在运行的 EC2 实例使用 EC2 实例配置文件。如果 EC2 实例没有附加实例配置文件，则 EC2 实例必须使用没有分配 IAM 权限的默认实例配置文件。DevOps 工程师审查账户并发现正在运行的 EC2 实例没有附加实例配置文件。在审查过程中，DevOps 工程师还观察到新建的 EC2 实例没有附加实例配置文件。哪种解决方案将确保所有现有和未来的 EC2 实例在区域内都附加实例配置文件？",
    "stemEn": "A company has a single AWS account that runs hundreds of Amazon EC2 instances in a single AWS Region. New EC2 instances are launched and terminated each hour in the account. The account also includes existing EC2 instances that have been running for longer than a week. The company's security policy requires all running EC2 instances to use an EC2 instance profile. If an EC2 instance does not have an instance profile attached, the EC2 instance must use a default instance profile that has no IAM permissions assigned. A DevOps engineer reviews the account and discovers EC2 instances that are running without an instance profile. During the review, the DevOps engineer also observes that new EC2 instances are being launched without an instance profile. Which solution will ensure that an instance profile is attached to all existing and future EC2 instances in the Region?",
