    "explanation": "题目分析与解答 1. 考察的知识点的工作原理及依赖项。的安装与配置。安全组配置与网络通信要求。实例配置文件与权限管理。 2. 选项分析正确。 Amazon Inspector 依赖 AWS Systems Manager Agent 来扫描实例。如果EC2 未安装或未运行，实例将无法被扫描。正确。 AWS Systems Manager 需要通过端口与服务端点通信。如果安全组未正确配置，实例将无法与 443 AWS Systems Manager通信。错误。此权限与启动 Amazon Inspector 评估相关，但与实例是否被扫描无关。错误。 EC2 Instance Connect 用于连接，与 SSH Amazon Inspector 扫描无关。正确。实例需要关联具有适当权限的实例配置文件，以便与 EC2 AWS Systems Manager 通信。错误。托管实例激活通常用于非实例（如本地服务器），而不是用于 EC2 Amazon EC2 实例。 3. 我选的答案 4. 官方答案 5. 与官方答案比较我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
    "explanationEn": "Amazon Inspector\nAWS Systems Manager Agent\nA. Verify that AWS Systems Manager Agent is installed and is running on the EC2 instances that Amazon Inspector is not scanning.\nAgent\nB. Associate the target EC2 instances with security groups that allow outbound communication on port 443 to the AWS Systems Manager\nservice endpoint.\nC. Grant inspector:StartAssessmentRun permissions to the IAM role that the DevOps engineer is using.\nD. Configure EC2 Instance Connect for the EC2 instances that Amazon Inspector is not scanning.\nE. Associate the target EC2 instances with instance profiles that grant permissions to communicate with AWS Systems Manager.\nF. Create a managed-instance activation. Use the Activation Code and the Activation ID to register the EC2 instances.\nB\nB",
