        "text": "Include the MD5 checksum within the Content-MD5 parameter. Check the operationxcall’s return status to find out if an error was returned.",
        "textEn": "Include the MD5 checksum within the Content-MD5 parameter. Check the operationxcall’s return status to find out if an error was returned.",
        "textZh": "将 MD5 校验和包含在 Content-MD5 参数中。检查操作调用返回的状态以确定是否返回错误。",
