        "textEn": "Create a CodePipeline action immediately after the deployment stage of the API. Configure the action to use the CodePipeline integration with API Gateway to export the SDK to Amazon S3. Create another action that uses the CodePipeline integration with Amazon S3 to invalidate the cache for the SDK path.",
        "textZh": "创建一个 CodePipeline 动作，立即在 API 部署阶段之后。配置动作使用 CodePipeline 与 API Gateway 的集成导出 SDK 到 Amazon S3。创建另一个动作使用 CodePipeline 与 Amazon S3 的集成缓存 SDK 路径无效。"
