    "stem": "DevOps 团队正在合并代码修订版本，用于使用 Amazon RDS Multi-AZ DB 集群的生产数据库的应用程序。DevOps 团队使用持续集成来定期验证应用程序的工作。DevOps 团队需要在更改部署到生产数据库之前测试更改。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A DevOps team is merging code revisions for an application that uses an Amazon RDS Multi-AZ DB cluster for its production database. The DevOps team uses continuous integration to periodically verify that the application works. The DevOps team needs to test the changes before the changes are deployed to the production database. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "DevOps 团队正在合并代码修订版本，用于使用 Amazon RDS Multi-AZ DB 集群的生产数据库的应用程序。DevOps 团队使用持续集成来定期验证应用程序的工作。DevOps 团队需要在更改部署到生产数据库之前测试更改。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
