        "textEn": "Set up Amazon CloudWatch Application Insights for the ECS cluster. Configure Application Insights to monitor key performance indicators of the microservices in the critical user journeys and API calls. Create CloudWatch alarms based on the insights. Use Amazon EventBridge to x atominitiate a rollback if necessary by using the alarms' invoke an AWS Step Functions workflow to evaluate the alarms. Configure the workflow built-in integration with Amazon ECS.",
        "textZh": "为 ECS 集群设置 Amazon CloudWatch Application Insights。将 Application Insights 配置为监控关键用户旅程和 API 调用中微服务的关键绩效指标。基于这些洞察创建 CloudWatch 警报。使用 Amazon EventBridge 调用 AWS Step Functions 工作流以评估这些警报。将该工作流配置为在必要时通过警报与 Amazon ECS 的内置集成启动回滚。"
