        "textEn": "Create CloudWatch Synthetics canaries that simulate critical user journeys and API calls. Implement AWS X-Ray tracing for all the microservices Configure X-Ray to send traces to CloudWatch. Create CloudWatch alarms based on error rates and latency metrics. Create an AWS Lambda function to analyze the traces and to initiate a rollback if necessary by using the alarms' built-in integration with Amazon ECS.",
        "textZh": "创建金丝雀（）来模拟关键用户旅程和调用。为所有微服务实现 CloudWatch Synthetics canaries API AWS X-Ray 追踪，将配 X-Ray 置为将追踪数据发送到。基于错误率和延迟指标创建告警。创建一个 CloudWatch CloudWatch AWS Lambda 函数来分析追踪数据，并在必要时通过告警与的内置集成来启动回滚。Amazon ECS"
