        "text": "Create CloudWatch Synthetics canaries that simulate critical user journeys and API calls. Configure the canaries to run against the new deployment. Create CloudWatch alarms that are invoked when canaries fail. Use the alarms’ built-in integration with Amazon ECS to initiate a rollback if the alarms are invoked before traffic is routed to the new deployment.",
        "textEn": "Create CloudWatch Synthetics canaries that simulate critical user journeys and API calls. Configure the canaries to run against the new deployment. Create CloudWatch alarms that are invoked when canaries fail. Use the alarms’ built-in integration with Amazon ECS to initiate a rollback if the alarms are invoked before traffic is routed to the new deployment.",
